    "The target branch does not contain all source commits. The worktree and branch were kept.": "目标分支尚未包含全部源提交。工作树和分支已保留。",
    "The target directory will switch to the selected branch before merging.": "合并前，目标目录会切换到所选分支。",
    "The worktree changed after the preview. It was kept.": "预览后工作树发生了变化，已保留。",
