    "This removes the folder at %@. The branch is kept. Git refuses removal if the worktree has uncommitted changes or untracked files.": "此操作会移除 %@ 文件夹，并保留分支。如果工作树包含未提交的更改或未跟踪文件，Git 会拒绝移除。",
